if () then ([v1 = 'fax'])
:input order into Excel file;
else ([v1 = 'mail or phone'])
:log order channel;
endif
:send Excel list to student;
:after a week;
:type orders into MS-Access database;
:ensure database typing is completed;
:control incoming order;
:At the same time, continue to do the check.;
:is order correct;
:v2: is order correct ({correct, incorrect}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'correct'])
:release order;
:Send the Excel list to the student and upon receiving it, continue with the process.;
:is order worth less than 5000;
:v3: is order worth less than 5000 ({yes, no}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v3 = 'yes'])
:If the order is worth less than 5.000 €, release it.;
else ([v3 = 'no'])
:split tasks for sign off and continue check;
:send order for sign off;
:continue check;
:contact selling agency and upon receiving actual issue send order for sign off;
:contact client and release order;
endif
:PPC initiates production upon receiving order;
:goods will be produced;
:can issue be solved;
:v4: can issue be solved ({no, yes}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = 'no'])
:cancel order;
stop
else ([v4 = 'yes'])
:release order;
:check quality of goods;
:create and send quality report to finance department;
:Release the order via memo and ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse.;
:ensure memo achieved in warehouse;
:v6: post release task ({invoice, commission, send}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v6 = 'invoice'])
:send invoice;
:report achievement to finance department;
case ([v6 = 'commission'])
:commission goods;
:sign and send memo;
case ([v6 = 'send'])
:send goods;
:ensure signed memo achieved in logistic department;
endswitch
:archive memo and close order;
:end process;
stop
